<title>USA: IVAX omits semiannual dividend.</title>
<headline>IVAX omits semiannual dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>IVAX Corp said Monday it omitted its semiannual dividend for the second half of 1996.</p>
<p>On June 3, 1996, IVAX paid a semiannual dividend of $0.05 per share to shareholders of record on May 10, 1996.</p>
</text>
